      ":question/problem": "![](images/13/13e721ba12144cfa122919f9a7bf95fe141fb179fddaa226727957c21731111b.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $AH^(\u2015)$ bisects angle $\u2220BAC$ and $BA^(\u2015)\u2245CA^(\u2015)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> *The segments $BH^(\u2015)$ and $CH^(\u2015)$ are congruent.*\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $BA^(\u2015)\u2245CA^(\u2015)$ | Given |\n| 2 | $\u2220BAH\u2245\u2220CAH$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 3 | $AH^(\u2015)\u2245AH^(\u2015)$ | {{field-2}} |\n| 4 | $\u25b3BAH\u2245\u25b3CAH$ | {{field-3}} |\n| 5 | $BH^(\u2015)\u2245CH^(\u2015)$ | CPCTC |"
