      ":question/problem": "![](images/9c/9c7db25bd044c6eeb6e389b1d76b36a13d7fa838096274387d58bf4d2f7297e2.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $H$ is the midpoint of $BC^(\u2015)$ and $AB^(\u2015)\u2245AC^(\u2015)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u2220B\u2245\u2220C$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $AB^(\u2015)\u2245AC^(\u2015)$ | Given |\n| 2 | $HB^(\u2015)\u2245HC^(\u2015)$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 3 | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |\n| 4 | $\u25b3AHB\u2245\u25b3AHC$ | {{field-4}} |\n| 5 | $\u2220B\u2245\u2220C$ | CPCTC |"
